    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parasite Echo</strong> is a third-person survival horror game that blends atmospheric exploration, tense combat, and puzzle-solving inside a derelict space facility consumed by a mysterious alien infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in isolation above the clouds, you'll play as <strong>Cira</strong>, a lone responder who must navigate the decaying corridors of <strong>CANOPY-6</strong> \u2014 a once-botanical research ship now overrun by hostile lifeforms and corrupted machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> labyrinthine halls filled with overgrown alien coral and fragments of a forgotten past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> infected creatures and malfunctioning security units using scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve</strong> environmental puzzles to restore power, access sealed zones, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the growing presence of something deeper... something that knows your name.</p></li></ul>",
